problem:
Find all real solutions to the system of equations:
\[
\begin{cases}
x^3 + y^3 + z^3 = 3xyz + 1, \\
x^2 + y^2 + z^2 = x + y + z.
\end{cases}

Find all integer solutions \((x, y, z)\) to the system of Diophantine equations:
\[
\begin{cases}
x^2 + y^2 + z^2 = 3xyz, \\
x + y + z = 0.
\end{cases}

Find all positive integers n for which there exists a polynomial p(x) with integer coefficients satisfying both of the following conditions:
1) p(1) = n;
2) for every integer k, there exists an integer r such that p(k) - 2^r is divisible by 2^(n + 2).

Let \( f \) be a function defined on the positive integers such that for all \( n \geq 1 \),
\[ f(n) = \left\{
    \begin{array}{ll}
        n^2 & \text{if } n \text{ is a perfect square}, \\
        3n + 1 & \text{otherwise}.
    \end{array}
\right.
\]
Find the number of integers \( n \) between 1 and 1000 for which \( f(n) \) is a perfect square.

A sequence of integers $a_1, a_2, a_3, \ldots$ is defined by $a_1 = 2$ and for $n \geq 1$,
\[a_{n+1} = \left\{
\begin{array}{cl}
a_n + 4 & \text{if } a_n \text{ is even,} \\
a_n - 1 & \text{if } a_n \text{ is odd.}
\end{array}
\right.\]

What is the smallest positive integer $k$ for which there exists an integer $m$ such that $a_m = 2015$ and $a_{m+k} = a_m$?

Consider the function $f: \mathbb{N} \to \mathbb{N}$ defined by the rule:
\[ f(n) = \left\{
\begin{array}{ll}
n + 1 & \text{if } n \text{ is odd} \\
\frac{n}{2} & \text{if } n \text{ is even}
\end{array}
\right. \]

Define a sequence $(a_k)$ starting with $a_0 = 2024$ such that $a_{k+1} = f(a_k)$ for all integers $k \geq 0$.

Determine the smallest integer $k$ for which $a_k$ becomes less than 10.

Find the smallest positive integer n such that in any set of n integers, there always exists four distinct elements x, y, z, and w satisfying:
1. x, y, z, w form an arithmetic progression (i.e., x, y, z, w are in arithmetic sequence with some common difference d);
2. x + z = y + w;
3. x - z and y - w have opposite signs.

Tìm số nguyên dương nhỏ nhất n sao cho tồn tại các số nguyên dương a_1, a_2, ..., a_n thỏa mãn:
1. a_1 + a_2 + ... + a_n = 2024;
2. a_1 + a_2 + ... + a_k không chia hết cho k với mọi 1 ≤ k < n.

Find the smallest positive integer n such that there exist positive integers a₁, a₂, ..., a_n that satisfy the following properties:
1. The sum of the elements in each subset of {a₁, a₂, ..., a_n} is a perfect square;
2. There exists a subset of size 3 such that the sum of its elements is exactly 2023.

Find all positive integers n for which there exists a finite sequence of distinct positive integers a_1, a_2, ..., a_n satisfying the following conditions:
1. 1 = a_1 < a_2 < ... < a_n;
